<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Soulfire</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 100)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast soulfire &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast soulfire</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The last and fiercest of the dark knight's fires: a fire that burns the very 
soul of the target. The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the more it burns. 
It does about as well against leather, chain and plate, and a little less 
against clothes. A shield takes some of 
it, but can't stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting. It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lava Flow</a>
